Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:17.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:17.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:24.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:24.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
