Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:30.46,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:37.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:37.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:42.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:46.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
